            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo a banhū abo baalī baaja nang'hwe būhaya, “Tūtūdūla ū kūlwa nago a ming'wana genayo, nguno galī na nguzu no kūtūheeba a bise. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
