              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na Manefili galīko (a ga kūfuma mu shibyalīlwe sha ng'wa Anaki, ūyo būbyīle wakwe būfumile kū Manefili.) Nīyo a bise twalibonaga gītī tūlī tūkūmbī dūhū; na a gene hū ūmo gaalūtūbonelaga a bise!’”",
          "type": "text",
